Subject: [PATCH 06870/11362] [outer-loop] ARC ls20 round-4: timed out on an
 agent-tooling bug, no artifact

Round-4 codex gpt-5.6-sol attempt on ls20's L5 timed out (2400s) before
writing an artifact. The live transcript shows the session died around
its own step 417 (frame level dropped to 0, a GAME_OVER/reset), then hit
an IndexError crash in its own PNG-rendering debug script that appears to
have stalled recovery for the remainder of the budget -- an agent-tooling
bug, not a game finding. Round-3's "insert the upper black-dot selector
before lower-pad orientation" hypothesis remains untested.

No registry count change, frontier stays at level 4.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JntPrUGLNesPcJH1pyfFYw
